ch that gates all automation except visual toggles. It automates field sweeping with serpentine routes over real flower patches, auto swinging the collector, converting at your hive, and rotating fields by laps, minutes, or conversions. Token collection supports type filtering with spawn metadata, while world automation covers sprouts, balloons, planters, puffshrooms, blooms, fireflies, leaves, meteors, and nectar pots. Combat features include mob hunting, evasion, kill aura that cycles targets in bee range, auto stinger, stump snail, and ant challenge, with the honest note that damage is server-side only. Quest rounds visit NPCs, claim and accept quests, and a hive section handles hatching eggs, royal jelly rolling, hive slots, and cell reports. Toys cover dispensers, passes, boosters, converters, and amulet generators, while economy tools handle consumables, sprinklers, buying gear by real item names, blender orders, shrine donations, sticker printer, memory match, promo codes, and amulet offers. Movement includes glide with implied noclip, teleports to fields, hive, shops, and NPCs, plus speed/jump boosts, infinite jump, noclip, and anti-AFK that reports honestly when executor APIs are unavailable. Visuals cover fullbright, no fog, and ESP for monsters, tokens, and sprouts, while performance includes max FPS presets, particle killing, graphics levels, and the game's own HideOtherBees and HideGlitchFX switches. A self-test prints what is and is not wired up, the Log tab shows recent activity, and themes plus saved configs come from FishyUI's addons.\n\nBSS, Bee Swarm, Bee Swarm Simulator","tags":[],"discord":"https://discord.gg/fishyhub","keyLink":"https://fishyhub.online","owner":{"_id":"6a3c5ce3e23ccd44d1db2827","username":"fishyzzz","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/618ce0ab4affa29322d7fd3de231a6378bb5b8f0e7195166e692d6b2689bb3b8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a3c5ce3e23ccd44d1db2827-1788304605349.jpeg"},"